    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a57b753347fe2d17bbe4ece",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后――每当她遭遇不幸之后，\n总会有人若无其事地给予帮助。\n她们应该也是以自己的方式在担心她吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b090587647657ba1f4ddfa8f658b9c937b535b1b604ad9f2cc841c9e16be76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
